  "details": "In VRChat game worlds—such as idle game worlds—after playing for a long time, when you re-enter an instance or perform a similar action to send your save data, a screen that says “Sending important data” appears.\n\nThis is normal behavior, but since the recent UI update, the screen gets stuck on “8 left,” the save data isn’t sent properly, and when you re-enter the instance, several hours’ worth of data gets rolled back.\n\nBefore the UI update, the screen never remained stuck at “8 left”; the data would be sent successfully in just a few seconds.\n\nIt appears that the UI update has caused a bug.\n\nTranslated with DeepL.com (free version)",
